{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} General Properties}
{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} General_Properties}
\pard\keepn \b\fs28\cf1 General Properties
\par \pard \plain\fs24 
\par \trowd\trgaph105\trleft-116 \cellx5425\cellx8525\pard\intbl This tab provides general settings for the trackerball
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl If \b Auto Y axis assignment \plain\fs24 is checked then the associated Y parameter of an XY pair is automatically assigned to the Y axis if the X parameter is assigned to the X axis
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl The Invert Axes settings may be used for some types of trackerball where the sense of rotation is reversed.
\par\intbl 
